  "notes": [
    "Diagram shows both a CONNECTION and SCHEMATIC panel; this netlist was traced from the CONNECTION DIAGRAM (left). The right SCHEMATIC panel is cropped at the right edge and was not separately transcribed.",
    "CTD (compressor time delay) internal terminals labeled T1/T2/T3 with a 'LOGIC' block; exact internal contact arrangement is not fully legible — series order of HPS/DTS/LPS traced as drawn but the T1 tie point is partly ambiguous.",
    "The indoor blower motor and thermostat G/R field wiring (dashed) is partly obscured; G and blower connections traced as best visible — field control wiring routing to external 24V supply is approximate.",
    "Contactor terminal numbering (11,21,23) taken from the printed pads; the two '23' pads (line-in and load-out) were split as 23L/23T for clarity.",
    "Start components ST/SC/SR (Note #8) wiring to the run capacitor HERM/C is partly overlapped; SR terminals 1,2,5 traced as labeled.",
    "LLS (liquid line solenoid) branch tap point into the low-voltage string is not fully clear where it returns to common."
  ]
